	"nodes":[
		{"id":"edcc41cd14877255","type":"group","x":-520,"y":-200,"width":4760,"height":2320,"color":"6","label":" FoundationPipeline"},
		{"id":"64ba9c721bfa1979","type":"group","x":-520,"y":2240,"width":2490,"height":840,"color":"3","label":"Collectors"},
		{"id":"26b339b5a4cc2e97","type":"text","text":"# Metrics&Benchmark\n\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: nav_metrics\n### Description:\nДва главных подхода использования:\n1. Training\n2. Testing FSDK","x":1360,"y":1520,"width":620,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a25e36c8b7237998","type":"text","text":"# nav_ros_tools\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: nav_ros_tools\n### Description:\nДля коммуникации Isaac'a и ROS2\n\n","x":1360,"y":820,"width":620,"height":560,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0bbf32ef5d693c4d","type":"text","text":"# SensorBox\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: sensor_box\n\n### Description:\n\nДля визуальной отладки положения сенсоров\n\nSensor boxes:\n* Для калибровки в команде навигации;\n* Пример сенсорного бокса на гуманоиде;\n\n\n\n\n\n#debug","x":1340,"y":120,"width":640,"height":560,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"efdb268019a9fc0c","type":"file","file":"Terrain Generator.md","x":-400,"y":2360,"width":620,"height":560,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fe9d70adb98eb14a","type":"text","text":"# Sensons\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: nav_sensors\n### Description:\nДля готовых сенсоров. Поддержка:\n* Only Isaac Sim;\n* Isaac Lab version;\n* ROS Sensors\n\n","x":320,"y":820,"width":620,"height":520,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"97c946f56549713b","type":"text","text":"# Scene-utils\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: nav_scene_utils\n### Description:\n\n### Functionallity\n* nav_mesh\n* spawn_maps (sber lab, gibson and so on)\n* Convertation tools (У команды locomotion есть urdf2usd)\n* Obstacle Tools\n","x":320,"y":1400,"width":620,"height":640,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ad60026e71803a6c","type":"text","text":"# Isaac Data Collector\n\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: terrain_generator\n### Description:\nДля генерация датасетов из isaac'a\n\nExamples:\n* Voxel Encoder\n* Synthetical(!) Data (**WIP**)\n","x":1080,"y":2360,"width":620,"height":560,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ad4b997d1424a0d9","type":"text","text":"# RL-Envs\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: nav_envs\n### Description:\nДля окружения для обучения и бенчмарков без ROS'a\n\n1. Train ver cfg\n2. Play ver cfg (use metrics or benchmark)\n3. Teleop version (instruction)\n\n  P.S. Benchmark  mb require special cfgs\n\n\n","x":2160,"y":1440,"width":780,"height":560,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"94e72f6f93653584","type":"text","text":"# **Voxel Grid Native Encoder** (Isaac)\n\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: nav_voxel_native\n### Description:\nДля симулирование для отдачи вокселей на GPU для обучения. Использует GT Mesh. \n","x":2270,"y":760,"width":560,"height":560,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"856e97d5b0ed31fb","type":"text","text":"# nav_learning\nlink: [repo]([https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/navigation/vint/-/tree/nomad_v1?ref_type=heads](https://git.sberrobots.ru/foundation/simulators/packages/terrain-generator))\npkg_name: nav_learning\n### Description:\nДля кода обучения RL. Не должен зависеть от Isaac'a. Должен писаться из расчета, что код обучения может быть даже на роботе, или в облаке. Все преобразования с данными должны быть в этом репозитории\n\n","x":3080,"y":1440,"width":620,"height":560,"color":"4"}
	],
